---
import Docs from "../layouts/Docs.astro";
import { upstream } from "../data/navigation";
const agents = [
  ["Codex 0.166.0", "Admitted", "Disabled", "Explicit model, schema 2 or 3"],
  [
    "Claude Code 2.1.304",
    "Unavailable",
    "Admitted",
    "Explicit full model ID, schema 2 or 3",
  ],
  ["Grok Build 1.0.70", "Unverified", "Admitted", "Native default, schema 3"],
  ["Antigravity 1.4.12", "Unverified", "Admitted", "Unverified, refused"],
  ["Gemini", "Unverified", "Unimplemented", "Unimplemented"],
];
---

<Docs
  title="Reference"
  description="Look up the two entry points, operation-specific agent support, tool groups and configuration precedence."
  toc={[
    ["commands", "Commands"],
    ["admissions", "Agent compatibility"],
    ["tools", "MCP tools"],
    ["config", "Configuration"],
    ["results", "Results and permissions"],
  ]}
>
  <h2 id="commands">Commands</h2>
  <dl>
    <dt>
      <code>clink generation-capabilities --json</code>
    </dt>
    <dd>
      Inspect generation schemas and family support locally. Add{" "}
      <code>--cli NAME --executable /absolute/path</code> to inspect a specific
      executable’s identity.
    </dd>
    <dt>
      <code>clink allow PATH --cli NAME</code>
    </dt>
    <dd>
      Approve an existing directory for the specified CLI. An explicit{" "}
      <code>--yes</code> grants it non-interactively. Native agent trust is
      managed separately.
    </dd>
    <dt>
      <code>clink generate --request-json -</code>
    </dt>
    <dd>
      Read one generation request from stdin and return one terminal JSON
      result.
    </dd>
    <dt>
      <code>clink-mcp-server --project PATH</code>
    </dt>
    <dd>Serve MCP tools over stdio for an explicitly bound workspace.</dd>
  </dl>
  <h2 id="admissions">Agent compatibility</h2>
  <p>
    The recorded checks cover exact macOS arm64 binaries, launch recipes and
    parsers. A different build can be installed and signed in while still being
    refused.{" "}
    <a href={upstream + "/blob/main/docs/release-evidence.md"}>
      Release evidence and limits
    </a>
    .
  </p>
  <div
    class="table-scroll"
    tabindex="0"
    role="region"
    aria-label="Agent compatibility table"
  >
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>Agent</th>
          <th>Consultation</th>
          <th>Native task</th>
          <th>Generation</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        {agents.map(([a, b, c, d]) => (
          <tr>
            <th scope="row">{a}</th>
            <td>{b}</td>
            <td>{c}</td>
            <td>{d}</td>
          </tr>
        ))}
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
  <h2 id="tools">MCP tools</h2>
  <p>
    All 18 tools are enabled by default. <code>DISABLED_TOOLS</code> can hide
    optional tools. <code>version</code> and <code>listmodels</code> stay
    available.
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>Consultation and delegation.</strong> <code>chat</code> and{" "}
      <code>clink</code>. The latter also accepts native task actions.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Investigation.</strong> <code>thinkdeep</code>,{" "}
      <code>codereview</code>, <code>precommit</code>, <code>debug</code>,{" "}
      <code>secaudit</code>, <code>analyze</code>, <code>refactor</code>,{" "}
      <code>testgen</code>.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Consultations and search.</strong> <code>consensus</code> and{" "}
      <code>apilookup</code>.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Local guidance.</strong> <code>planner</code>, <code>docgen</code>
      , <code>tracer</code>, <code>challenge</code>.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Discovery.</strong> <code>listmodels</code> and{" "}
      <code>version</code>.
    </li>
  </ul>
  <h2 id="config">Configuration</h2>
  <p>
    Clink loads client manifests in the order below. A later definition replaces
    the entire named client.
  </p>
  <ol>
    <li>Bundled client defaults</li>
    <li>
      Legacy <code>~/.pal/cli_clients/</code>
    </li>
    <li>
      User <code>~/.clink/cli_clients/</code>
    </li>
    <li>
      Explicitly bound project <code>.clink/cli_clients/</code>
    </li>
    <li>
      <code>CLI_CLIENTS_CONFIG_PATH</code>
    </li>
  </ol>
  <p>
    Generation loads operator configuration independently of the request’s
    project path. See{" "}
    <a href={upstream + "/blob/main/docs/cli-configuration.md"}>
      CLI configuration
    </a>{" "}
    and{" "}
    <a href={upstream + "/blob/main/docs/generation-native-setup.md"}>
      generation setup
    </a>
    .
  </p>
  <h2 id="results">Results and permissions</h2>
  <p>
    An agent’s reported model can be unknown even when its requested model is
    explicit. Completion confirms final response transport. Check the answer and
    any file changes independently. Approved roots constrain project and context
    selection. Native tools retain their configured permissions, and
    cancellation cannot undo earlier changes.
  </p>
  <p>
    Read the{" "}
    <a href={upstream + "/blob/main/docs/generation-native-protocol.md"}>
      schema 2 contract
    </a>
    ,{" "}
    <a href={upstream + "/blob/main/docs/generation-native-families.md"}>
      schema 3 contract
    </a>{" "}
    and <a href={upstream + "/blob/main/SECURITY.md"}>security policy</a> for
    full details.
  </p>
</Docs>
